          "text": "One destitute of strength; esp., one of feeble mind.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
        {
          "text": "To weaken; to make imbecile; as, to imbecile men's courage.",
          "partOfSpeech": "verb"
        }
      ],
